                    "url": "/serie/stream/star-wars-skeleton-crew",
                    "title": "Star Wars: Skeleton Crew",
                    "author": "Jon Favreau, Dave Filoni, Susan McNamara, & 4 weitere, Christopher Ford, Kathleen Kennedy, Erin Mitchell, Jon Watts",
